2
00:03:33,200 --> 00:03:35,300
アニソンナイトフィーバー！
Anison Night Fever!

3
00:04:48,500 --> 00:04:51,900
放て！心に刻んだ夢を
Fire! The dream engraved in my heart...

4
00:04:51,900 --> 00:04:55,400
未来さえ置き去りにして
...leaving even the future behind!

5
00:04:55,400 --> 00:04:58,400
限界など知らない 意味無い
I know no limits, they're meaningless!

6
00:04:58,400 --> 00:05:00,100
この力が
This power...

7
00:05:00,100 --> 00:05:01,800
光散らす
...will scatter the light!

8
00:05:01,608 --> 00:05:07,908
この能力が光散らす その先に遥かな想いを
My ability scatters light, with far-off feelings lying ahead

9
00:05:10,108 --> 00:05:15,608
歩いてきたこの道を 振り返ることしか
If I can do nothing but look back...

10
00:05:15,608 --> 00:05:22,608
出来ないなら...今ここで全てを壊せる
...on this path I've walked, I can destroy everything here and now

11
00:05:23,408 --> 00:05:29,408
暗闇に落ちる街並み 人はどこまで立ち向かえるの？
How long can people stand against the town falling into darkness?

12
00:05:29,408 --> 00:05:36,808
加速するその痛みから 誰かをきっと守れるよ
I can surely protect someone from that accelerating pain

13
00:05:36,808 --> 00:05:41,108
Looking! The blitz loop this planet to search way.

14
00:05:41,108 --> 00:05:44,608
Only my RAILGUN can shoot it. 今すぐ
Only my RAILGUN can shoot it. Right now...

15
00:05:44,608 --> 00:05:50,608
身体中を光の速さで 駆け巡った確かな予感
...a definite premonition raced through my body at the speed of light

16
00:05:50,608 --> 00:05:57,108
掴め！望むものなら残さず 輝ける自分らしさで
Seize it! If it's what you wish for, leave nothing behind with your shining self

17
00:05:57,108 --> 00:06:01,608
信じてるよあの日の誓いを
I believe in the oath of that day

18
00:06:01,608 --> 00:06:09,108
この瞳に光る涙 それさえも強さになるから
Even the tears shining in these eyes will turn into strength

19
00:06:12,108 --> 00:06:18,108
立ち止まると少しだけ 感じる切なさに
When I stop, I won't lie about being...

20
00:06:18,108 --> 00:06:24,608
戸惑う事無いなんて 嘘はつかないよ
...unbothered by the slight sadness I feel

21
00:06:25,408 --> 00:06:31,408
宙に舞うコインが描く 放物線が決める運命
The parabola drawn by the coin dancing in the air decides destiny

22
00:06:31,408 --> 00:06:38,608
打ち出した答えが今日も 私の胸を駆け巡る
The answer I shot out races through my heart again today

23
00:06:39,108 --> 00:06:43,108
Sparkling! The shiny lights awake true desire.

24
00:06:43,108 --> 00:06:46,908
Only my RAILGUN can shoot it. 必ず
Only my RAILGUN can shoot it. Surely...

25
00:06:46,908 --> 00:06:53,608
貫いてく途惑うことなく 傷ついても走り続ける
...I will pierce through without hesitation, continuing to run even if hurt

26
00:06:53,608 --> 00:07:00,108
狙え！凛と煌く視線は 狂い無く闇を切り裂く
Aim! The sharp and glittering gaze slices through the darkness without fail

27
00:07:00,108 --> 00:07:09,608
迷いなんて吹き飛ばせばいい この心が叫ぶ限り 誰ひとり邪魔などさせない
Blow away any hesitation! As long as my heart screams, no one can get in my way

28
00:07:40,108 --> 00:07:46,608
儚く舞う無数の願いは この両手に積もってゆく
Countless wishes dancing fleetingly accumulate in these hands

29
00:07:46,608 --> 00:07:53,108
切り裂く闇に見えてくるのは 重く深く切ない記憶
What comes to sight through the sliced darkness is a heavy, deep, painful memory

30
00:07:53,108 --> 00:08:00,408
色褪せてく現実に揺れる 絶望には負けたくない
Swaying in the fading reality, I don't want to lose to despair

31
00:08:00,408 --> 00:08:07,108
私が今私であることを 胸を張って全て誇れる
I can hold my head high and be proud of who I am right now

32
00:08:07,108 --> 00:08:11,108
Looking! The blitz loop this planet to search way.

33
00:08:11,108 --> 00:08:14,608
Only my RAILGUN can shoot it. 今すぐ
Only my RAILGUN can shoot it. Right now...

34
00:08:14,608 --> 00:08:20,108
身体中を光の速さで 駆け巡った確かな予感
...a definite premonition raced through my body at the speed of light

35
00:08:20,108 --> 00:08:26,608
放て！心に刻んだ夢を 未来さえ置き去りにして
Fire! Leaving even the future behind with the dream engraved in my heart

36
00:08:26,608 --> 00:08:33,608
限界など知らない意味無い この能力が光散らす
I know no limits, they're meaningless! This ability scatters light...

37
00:08:33,608 --> 00:08:39,608
その先に遥かな想いを
...with far-off feelings lying ahead

38
00:09:21,608 --> 00:09:27,108
突然降る夕立 あぁ傘もないや嫌
A sudden evening shower, ah, I have no umbrella, how annoying

39
00:09:27,108 --> 00:09:31,608
空のご機嫌なんか知らない
I don't care about the mood of the sky

40
00:09:31,608 --> 00:09:37,108
季節の変わり目の服は 何着りゃいいんだろ
What should I wear during the change of seasons?

41
00:09:37,108 --> 00:09:41,608
春と秋どこいっちゃったんだよ
Where did spring and autumn go?

42
00:09:41,608 --> 00:09:46,608
息が出来ない情報の圧力
The pressure of information makes it hard to breathe

43
00:09:46,608 --> 00:09:51,608
めまいの螺旋だ 私はどこにいる
It's a spiral of dizziness, where am I?

44
00:09:51,608 --> 00:09:57,108
こんなに こんなに 息の音がするのに
Even though my breathing is this, this loud

45
00:09:57,108 --> 00:10:01,608
変だね 世界の音が...
It's strange, the sound of the world...

46
00:10:02,896 --> 00:10:06,696
足りない 足りない 誰にも気づかれない
It's not enough, not enough, noticed by no one.

47
00:10:06,696 --> 00:10:12,096
殴り書きみたいな音 出せない状態で叫んだよ
I screamed with notes like scribbles, unable to make a sound.

48
00:10:12,096 --> 00:10:17,096
「ありのまま」なんて誰に見せるんだ
Who would I show "my true self" to anyway?

49
00:10:17,096 --> 00:10:22,096
馬鹿な私は歌うだけ
A fool like me can only sing.

50
00:10:22,096 --> 00:10:25,596
ぶちまけちゃおうか 星に
Should I just pour it all out to the stars?

51
00:10:36,096 --> 00:10:42,096
エリクサーに張り替える作業もなんとなくなんだ
Even changing to Elixir strings is done for no real reason.

52
00:10:42,096 --> 00:10:45,896
欠けた爪を少し触る
I gently touch my chipped fingernail.

53
00:10:45,896 --> 00:10:52,096
半径300mmの体で必死に鳴いてる
Crying out desperately with this 300mm-radius body.

54
00:10:52,096 --> 00:10:56,196
音楽にとっちゃココが地球だな
To music, this must be what Earth is.

55
00:10:56,196 --> 00:11:01,596
空気を握って 空を殴るよ
I clench the air and punch the sky.

56
00:11:01,596 --> 00:11:06,096
何も起きない わたしは無力さ
Nothing happens, I am completely powerless.

57
00:11:06,096 --> 00:11:12,096
だけどその手でこの鉄を弾いたら
But if I play these iron strings with my hands...

58
00:11:12,096 --> 00:11:16,396
何かが変わって見えた
...something seemed to change.

59
00:11:16,396 --> 00:11:21,896
眩しい 眩しい そんなに光るなよ
It's too bright, too bright, don't shine so much.

60
00:11:21,896 --> 00:11:27,096
わたしのダサい影がより色濃くなってしまうだろ
It'll only make my pathetic shadow stand out even more.

61
00:11:27,096 --> 00:11:31,896
なんでこんな熱くなっちゃってんだろ 止まんない
Why am I getting so worked up? I can't stop.

62
00:11:31,896 --> 00:11:36,896
馬鹿な私は歌うだけ
A fool like me can only sing.

63
00:11:36,896 --> 00:11:40,096
うるさいんだって 心臓
Shut up, my beating heart!

64
00:11:49,396 --> 00:11:54,096
青い惑星 ひとりぼっち
A lonely, blue planet...

65
00:11:54,096 --> 00:11:59,596
いっぱいの音を聞いてきた
...has listened to so many sounds.

66
00:11:59,596 --> 00:12:04,596
回り続けて数億年
It has kept spinning for hundreds of millions of years.

67
00:12:04,596 --> 00:12:10,096
一瞬でもいいから
Even just for a brief moment...

68
00:12:10,096 --> 00:12:12,596
聴いて 聴けよ
...listen, listen to me!

69
00:12:12,596 --> 00:12:16,096
わたし わたし わたしはここにいる
I am, I am, I am right here!

70
00:12:16,096 --> 00:12:21,596
殴り書きみたいな音 出せない状態で叫んだよ
I screamed with notes like scribbles, unable to make a sound.

71
00:12:21,596 --> 00:12:26,596
何かになりたい なりたい 何者かでいい
I want to become something, anything at all!

72
00:12:26,596 --> 00:12:31,596
馬鹿な私は歌うだけ
A fool like me can only sing.

73
00:12:31,596 --> 00:12:36,096
ぶちまけちゃおうか 星に
Should I just pour it all out to the stars?

74
00:13:04,596 --> 00:13:08,396
また聴いてくれてありがとう！
Thank you for listening again!

75
00:13:08,396 --> 00:13:15,596
聴いてくれるこの環境、とっても嬉しく思います！
I'm so happy to have an environment where you all listen!

76
00:13:15,596 --> 00:13:24,096
いやー、お披露目ライブぶりかもね。もうかなり難しくて、練習頑張ったんでどうだったかな？
Wow, this might be my first time since my debut live. It was so hard, but I practiced so much! How was it?

77
00:13:24,096 --> 00:13:29,096
よかった？嬉しいよ！
Was it good? I'm so happy!

78
00:13:29,096 --> 00:13:35,396
ホロライブ四期生、角巻わため、です！
Hololive 4th generation, Tsunomaki Watame, here!

79
00:13:35,396 --> 00:13:44,096
これみよがしに弾いております。今日でなんと、9歳になりました！
I played it proudly. And today, I turned 9 years old!

80
00:13:44,096 --> 00:13:49,396
お祝いっぱい、ありがとう！ありがとうございます！
Thank you for all the celebrations! Thank you so much!

81
00:13:49,396 --> 00:14:00,596
いやー、この日のためにね、もうたくさんたくさん、もう頑張って準備もしてきたので、ぜひ最後まで見て楽しんでほしいなと思います！
Man, I've worked so, so hard and prepared so much for this day, so I hope you'll enjoy watching until the very end!

82
00:14:00,596 --> 00:14:03,596
よろしくベイビー！
Let's go, baby!

83
00:14:03,596 --> 00:14:08,096
ということでね、これはあの、片付けますね。もう使わないのでね。
So, I'm going to put this away. Since I won't be using it anymore.

84
00:14:08,096 --> 00:14:11,596
はい、ちょっと待っててね。よしよし。
Okay, please wait a moment. There we go.

85
00:14:11,596 --> 00:14:17,596
おっこいしょ。このギター、あ、ギターが、おいしょおいしょ。
Heave-ho. This guitar... Oh, the guitar... There we go.

86
00:14:17,596 --> 00:14:25,596
はぁ。わぁ、おっけー。ふぅ。肩凝りになっちまう。よいしょ。
*sighs* Wow, okay. Whew. My shoulders are getting stiff. There we go.

87
00:14:25,596 --> 00:14:30,596
いや、待っててくれてありがとうございました。
Thank you so much for waiting.

88
00:14:30,596 --> 00:14:35,596
今日のハッシュタグはなんと、前代未聞！
Today's hashtag is actually unprecedented!

89
00:14:35,596 --> 00:14:41,596
こちら！角巻わため生誕祭2025なので、
This one! #TsunomakiWatameBirthdayCelebration2025, so...

90
00:14:41,596 --> 00:14:47,596
こちらのハッシュタグをつけて、もうたくさんたくさんポストしていただけると嬉しいです！
I'd be so happy if you could use this hashtag to post lots and lots of tweets!

91
00:14:47,596 --> 00:14:52,096
今日はアニソンナイトフィーバー、楽しんで、いけますか？！
Are you ready to enjoy Anisong Night Fever today?!

92
00:14:52,096 --> 00:14:54,596
いけますか？！
Are you ready?!

93
00:14:54,596 --> 00:14:58,596
わたは、いけます！！！
Watame is totally ready!!!

94
00:14:58,596 --> 00:15:04,596
では、アニソンナイトフィーバー、いくぞー！！！
Then, Anisong Night Fever, here we go!!!

95
00:15:05,977 --> 00:15:07,477
お？なんだこれは？
Oh? What is this?

96
00:15:08,377 --> 00:15:13,477
こんなのステージに置いてあったら、いけないでしょ？つぎに...
It shouldn't be left on the stage like this, right? Next...

97
00:15:14,077 --> 00:15:16,177
何これ？
What is this?

98
00:15:16,177 --> 00:15:19,977
あ？何なの？誰これ置いたの？あ？
Ah? What is it? Who put this here? Ah?

99
00:15:20,277 --> 00:15:22,477
なんじゃこりゃ？！
What on earth is this?!

100
00:15:46,777 --> 00:15:54,977
このままもう少し歩こう 肩を抱き
Let's walk a little further like this, shoulder to shoulder

101
00:15:54,977 --> 00:16:03,177
消えゆく夢を数え 枯れてく仲間を見た
Counting the vanishing dreams, looking at our withering friends

102
00:16:03,177 --> 00:16:11,277
通い慣れた道に迷い込むこのごろ
Lately, getting lost on a path I'm used to walking

103
00:16:11,277 --> 00:16:19,477
闇がもう一人の自分をつくる
The darkness creates another version of myself

104
00:16:19,477 --> 00:16:27,977
渇いた叫びが くじけそうな胸を突き刺す
A dry scream pierces my disheartened chest

105
00:16:27,977 --> 00:16:35,977
君を誘って世界を見たいな
I want to invite you to see the world

106
00:16:35,977 --> 00:16:44,477
だれにも出せない答えが僕の中にある
An answer no one can give lies deep inside of me

107
00:16:44,477 --> 00:16:48,977
駆け引きがカギ
Tactics are the key

108
00:16:48,977 --> 00:16:53,977
とどけ fly at higher game
Reach out, fly at a higher game

109
00:17:04,777 --> 00:17:12,477
いくつの悲しみを一緒に越えただろう？
How many sadnesses have we overcome together?

110
00:17:12,477 --> 00:17:20,477
気が済むまで求めたあの日の僕達がいた
We were there on that day, seeking until we were satisfied

111
00:17:20,477 --> 00:17:28,477
時代が巡るなら またどこかで会えるね
If time turns around, we'll meet again somewhere

112
00:17:28,477 --> 00:17:36,477
その時が来るまで諦めない
Until that time comes, I won't give up

113
00:17:36,477 --> 00:17:44,977
冷めてく想いはどうしても否めないけど
I can't deny that my feelings are cooling down, but...

114
00:17:44,977 --> 00:17:52,977
恋に落ちて変わってくのもいいね
...it's nice to fall in love and change

115
00:17:52,977 --> 00:18:01,477
焦らず騒がずあるがままでと願うから
Because I wish to stay as I am without rushing or making a fuss

116
00:18:01,477 --> 00:18:10,977
心に花を咲かそう just take my heart
Let's make a flower bloom in our hearts, just take my heart

117
00:18:36,477 --> 00:18:44,977
渇いた叫びが くじけそうな胸を突き刺す
A dry scream pierces my disheartened chest

118
00:18:44,977 --> 00:18:52,977
君を誘って世界を見たいな
I want to invite you to see the world

119
00:18:52,977 --> 00:19:01,977
だれにも出せない答えが夢の中にある
An answer no one can give lies deep inside our dreams

120
00:19:01,977 --> 00:19:05,977
僕を信じて
Believe in me

121
00:19:05,977 --> 00:19:10,477
咲かそう just take my heart
Let it bloom, just take my heart

122
00:19:10,477 --> 00:19:16,977
旅路は続いてく
The journey goes on

123
00:20:23,152 --> 00:20:28,152
明日続く坂道の途中で
On the way up the hill that leads to tomorrow,

124
00:20:28,152 --> 00:20:34,152
すれ違う大人達は呟くさ
the adults passing by mutter to themselves...

125
00:20:34,452 --> 00:20:39,352
「愛」とか「夢」とか理想も解るけど
"We understand love, dreams, and ideals, but..."

126
00:20:39,352 --> 00:20:44,752
目の前の現現実(うつつ)はそんなに甘くない、って
"...they say reality in front of us isn't that sweet."

127
00:20:44,952 --> 00:20:47,552
つまずきながらも
Even while stumbling,

128
00:20:47,552 --> 00:20:50,152
転がりながらも
even while rolling along,

129
00:20:50,452 --> 00:20:56,052
カサブタだらけの情熱を忘れたくない
I don't want to forget this passion covered in scabs.

130
00:20:56,252 --> 00:20:59,052
大人になれない僕らの
For us who cannot become adults,

131
00:20:59,052 --> 00:21:01,652
強がりをひとつ聞いてくれ
please listen to one of our bluffs.

132
00:21:01,652 --> 00:21:04,652
逃げも隠れもしないから
Since we won't run or hide,

133
00:21:04,652 --> 00:21:07,652
笑いたい奴だけ笑え
laugh if you want to laugh.

134
00:21:07,652 --> 00:21:10,352
せめて頼りない僕らの
At least, please don't pluck the bud

135
00:21:10,352 --> 00:21:13,052
自由の芽を摘み取らないで
of our unreliable freedom.

136
00:21:13,052 --> 00:21:15,952
水をあげるその役目を
If you just fulfill the role of watering it,

137
00:21:15,952 --> 00:21:19,452
果たせばいいんだろう？
wouldn't that be enough?

138
00:21:23,152 --> 00:21:28,852
何度も繰り返した失敗とか
Mistakes we've repeated over and over again,

139
00:21:28,852 --> 00:21:34,052
大きく食い違った考えとか
and thoughts that vastly clashed...

140
00:21:34,452 --> 00:21:39,652
僕らの基準はとても不確かで
Our standards are so uncertain.

141
00:21:39,652 --> 00:21:44,852
昨日よりなんとなく歩幅が広くなった
Our stride has somehow gotten wider than yesterday.

142
00:21:45,052 --> 00:21:47,652
背伸びをしながら
While stretching ourselves,

143
00:21:47,652 --> 00:21:50,452
打ちのめされながら
even while being beaten down,

144
00:21:50,452 --> 00:21:56,252
カサブタをちょっとはがすけど 答えは出ない
we peel off our scabs a bit, but there is no answer.

145
00:21:56,252 --> 00:21:59,252
大人になりたい僕らの
For us who want to become adults,

146
00:21:59,252 --> 00:22:01,852
わがままをひとつ聞いてくれ
please listen to one of our selfish desires.

147
00:22:01,852 --> 00:22:04,652
寝ても覚めても縛られる
