160
00:23:00,452 --> 00:23:05,652
果たせばいいんだろう？
wouldn't that be enough?

161
00:23:42,652 --> 00:23:46,452
会いたいな 会えないな
I want to see you, but I can't...

162
00:23:46,452 --> 00:23:50,452
切ないな この気持ち
This feeling is so painful.

163
00:23:50,452 --> 00:23:54,252
言えないの 言いたいの
I can't say it, but I want to say it.

164
00:23:54,252 --> 00:23:58,152
チャンス逃してばかり
I'm always letting my chances slip away.

165
00:23:58,152 --> 00:24:01,452
だって だって
Because, because...

166
00:24:01,452 --> 00:24:05,852
翼 広げ 二人で
spreading our wings together,

167
00:24:05,852 --> 00:24:12,852
空をマラソン 夢をユニゾンしたい
I want to run through the sky and harmonize our dreams.

168
00:24:12,852 --> 00:24:14,852
ほら Catch You Catch You
Look! Catch you, catch you...

169
00:24:14,852 --> 00:24:17,152
Catch Me Catch Me 待って
catch me, catch me... wait!

170
00:24:17,152 --> 00:24:18,952
こっちをむいて
Turn this way

171
00:24:18,952 --> 00:24:21,052
スキだと言って決めて
and tell me you love me.

172
