そう Nice to Meet You Good to See You きっと
Yes! Nice to meet you, good to see you, surely...

173
00:24:24,452 --> 00:24:26,652
私の想い あなたのハートに
my feelings will fly right into your heart,

174
00:24:26,652 --> 00:24:29,652
飛んで飛んで飛んでいけ
fly, fly, fly away!

175
00:24:29,652 --> 00:24:32,652
迷わない
I won't hesitate!

176
00:24:46,652 --> 00:24:50,652
たまにね なくなっちゃう
Sometimes, you know, it runs completely flat...

177
00:24:50,652 --> 00:24:54,452
からだのバッテリー
the battery of my body.

178
00:24:54,452 --> 00:24:58,152
あなたの笑顔で
