おねがい
Please...

182
00:25:03,500 --> 00:25:04,800
おねがい
Please...

183
00:25:04,800 --> 00:25:05,800
おねがい
Please...

184
00:25:05,800 --> 00:25:09,800
まずはお友達から
First, let's start as friends.

185
00:25:09,800 --> 00:25:11,700
笑って 見つめて
With laughs and gazes,

186
00:25:11,700 --> 00:25:13,800
楽しい毎日にしたい
I want to make every day fun.

187
00:25:17,100 --> 00:25:20,800
ほら Catch You Catch You Catch Me Catch Me ゼッタイ
Look, Catch you, catch you, catch me, catch me, definitely!

188
00:25:21,300 --> 00:25:24,300
運命だって お似合いだって そう
Destiny, they say we're a perfect match, yes!

189
00:25:24,300 --> 00:25:27,800
ナイス Meet You Good to See You きっと
Nice to meet you, good to see you, surely!

190
00:25:27,800 --> 00:25:30,300
誰にも負けない あなたに世界で
I won't lose to anyone in the world for you,

191
00:25:30,300 --> 00:25:33,800
一番 一番 一番 一番
You are number one, number one, number one...

192
00:25:33,800 --> 00:25:36,300
コ・イ・シ・テ・ル
I'm in love with you!

193
00:25:58,800 --> 00:26:01,100
ほら Catch You Catch You Catch Me Catch Me 待って
Look, Catch you, catch you, catch me, catch me, wait!

194
